        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Kiosk Mode** locks your iPad (or iPhone) to a single app and relaunches it automatically, turning a device into a single-purpose kiosk.\n\nThis is the setup app: pick the target app and manage the kiosk settings from a simple onboarding flow. The lock and auto-relaunch behavior lives in the companion SpringBoard tweak (**KioskMode**, package `com.max.kioskmode`); install both for the full feature.\n\n- Choose any installed app to lock to\n- Auto-relaunch if the app is closed\n- Escape a locked session with a volume-button triple-press\n\nRequires iOS/iPadOS 17+ and **AppSync Unified** to run the setup app."
        },
